{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisite: Elf (high)\n\nYour study of high elven lore has unlocked fey power that few other elves possess, except your eladrin cousins. Drawing on your fey ancestry, you can enhance your ability to stride through the Feywild to shorten your path from one place to another. You gain the following benefits:\n\n- Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n\n- You learn to speak, read, and write Sylvan\n\n- You know and can cast the Misty Step spell once per long rest. Intelligence, Wisdom or Charisma is your spellcasting ability for it.\n\nIn addition, when you reach 5th level and learn the Misty Step spell due to your racial feature, you can cast it freely a number of times equal to the modifier you enhanced when you took this feat (minimum of 2). You must then finish a long rest in order to do so again.","level":1}],"id":"Custom7224d49e-2646-401b-9adf-8a86a46f4031","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Fey Teleportation [NPHB] [SM] [R]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}